    "interpretation": "Q1 (beats_deployable_H_top): test AUC lift > +0.05 AND >= 1.5x H_top's 50%-coverage NDCG@10 selective gain. Q2 (closes_gap_to_oracle): learned model recovers >= 33% of the (oracle - H_top) AURC gap. The ORACLE sorts by REALIZED rank-of-positive (not just top-1 correctness), so it is a loose upper bound that even a near-perfect correctness classifier cannot reach -- Q1 is the deployable, decision-relevant question; Q2 measures distance to a rank-aware ceiling."
  }
}